WEBVTT

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:05.400
Ishiyama High, a den of delinquents.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:13.240
120% JDs, and yet <i>they</i> are coming 
to this school just as any other...

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.240
<b>Attention! Tomorrow we will hold Ability Assessment Tests! - Teacher</b>

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.220
Ability Assessment Tests?

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:22.330
Did we even have tests in this school at all?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.650
My ability to stare people 
down ain't second-to-none!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.340
Don't underestimate my 
evil-eye ability, buddy!

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.640
Ability? Is that the kind 
of ability it means?

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.090
At our school? I can believe it.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.720
Furuichi, you fool! Look at 
the subjects for the tests!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.410
There are four of them!

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.270
Japanese?!

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.040
Arithmetic?!

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:44.740
Science?!

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.230
Good night... I mean, Social Studies!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.650
The teachers are being serious here!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.730
Uh, aren't those elementary school subjects?

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.800
Well, I suppose we've got to do it.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.990
After all this is...

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:03.250
Ishiyama High, where everyone 
hates studying 180%!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.230
I guess I might as well 
try to study a little bit.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.180
Let's do this "studyin' for a test" thing.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:17.140
Oh! You may be a baby, but 
you <i>are</i> a baby Demon Lord.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.650
Do you understand how to study?

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.240
This ain't time for foolin' around!

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:40.250
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.540
through some strange 
circumstances, is raising a...

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.990
Eww, it smells like burnt toast!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:28.970
<b>Baby Beel's Assessment Test</b>

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.570
Uno!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:41.490
Great Demon Lord, I am afraid 
that is a different game...

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.400
Oh, is it?

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:47.260
I ain't been asleep in like, forever! 
My head's all spaced out like...

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.500
Perhaps it is time to call it quits?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.000
Anyways...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.730
What about my son?

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.790
He growin' up nice 'nd all that?

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.630
He should be showing his ability 
as a Demon Lord 'bout now.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.620
Yes.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:03.200
The Zebul Spell has appeared on the arm of 
the human who has become the master's parent.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.150
He seems to be progressing steadily.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.700
For reals!? Kickin'!

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:09.820
Whoa there...

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:12.540
It's just, man, wish I could see 'im, yeah?

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.100
How much has he really grown?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.480
I know! Let's do <i>that</i>!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.650
By <i>that</i> you are referring to...?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.400
You know... <i>That</i>...

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.640
An assessment test!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.470
...and that's how it is.

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.910
<b>Good luck! - Great Demon Lord</b>

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.770
He's got a test too?

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:31.270
And sheesh, this Great Demon 
Lord's just as loopy as ever.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:36.420
The master needs to defeat 100 
humans within the next week.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.070
You get 1 point for each one you defeat.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.050
Less than 30 points, and you fail.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.580
That ain't somethin' to get excited about!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:48.550
Oh, but if the master isn't enthusiastic 
about this, it will be <i>you</i> who will suffer.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.810
And what do you mean by that?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.470
If he fails...

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:57.470
Hellish remedials await him in a 
special room in the Demon World.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.530
<b>Failure</b>

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:02.300
And as the master's parent, 
you will join him, of course.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.290
Anyway, are you gonna be okay?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.710
Nope. I'm not okay, not by a long shot.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.010
By the way, 10 cats gets 
him one point, it seems.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.920
I-I gotta do something!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:38.620
I gotta dump him off on 
someone quick, or else...

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:43.860
Sure, but we've got our own tests this 
week. We don't have time for that!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.920
That's it! Those tests!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:52.490
To be the parent of the Demon Lord requires 
being strong, brutal, and having brains!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:57.350
The reason Baby Beel didn't latch on to any 
of them was because they were all idiots!

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.030
Whoever gets the best marks 
on this assessment test

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:06.490
will have the perfect combination 
of brawn, brutality, and brains!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.990
If I dump Baby Beel onto that guy, then...

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.940
Isn't this right?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.150
Good night, my little kitties...

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.400
How about I give you some private lessons?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.450
We don't want any. Get lost.

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.520
We're totally great at Japanese.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.400
See?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.550
You do know some pretty 
difficult kanji, yes...

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.490
But how about English?

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.780
I'll hold your hand as 
I step you through it...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.810
They told you to get lost.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.540
Now get!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.790
Good night...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.150
He can't even spell "good night"!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.050
Oh, are those the right kanji?

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:02.110
<b>It's like he's got eyes in the back(ushiro) of his head. (U-"Heavens" Shi-"Death" Ro-"Dew")</b>

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.940
<b>The next day(yokujitsu) the weather will be lovely(kaisei).
 (Yo-"Night" Ku-"Suffering" Ji-"Path" Tsu-"Pain")
(Ka-"Beauty" I-"Intimidate" Se-"Height" I-"Intimidate")</b>

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.320
Everyone's seriously dumb, like really dumb!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.900
Cry (nakuyo), ye bush warbler: Heian Palace.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:22.960
<b>Mnemonic for remembering years:
i (ichi) = 1
yo (yon) = 4
ko (go) = 5
ro (roku) 6
na (nana) = 7
ha (hachi) = 8
ku (kyuu) = 9
</b>

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:18.720
Create a nice box(ii hako): Kamakura Bakufu.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.110
Awesome, Shiroyama-san!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.330
So that's how you remember them?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.630
Well, Shiro-chan, "Create a 
nice box" is nice and all,

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.970
but do you know what year it stands for?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.840
"Ii hako tsukurou."

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.380
I I Ha Ko Tsu Ku Ro U

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.350
1 8 5 9 6!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.600
It was in the year 18,596!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.380
I'm like, moved!

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.480
That's waaay into the future!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:50.860
We got trouble! Kanzaki-san's havin' a 
showdown with Suppon High by the riverside!

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.490
Oh, yeah?!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.200
Let's go, boys!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.080
Don't seem much like test 
studyin' around here...

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.120
Is this gonna be okay?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.870
FYI, you get 1 point for 100 camel crickets.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.640
Good night...

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.910
I don't have a clue!

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.800
But this isn't the real issue...

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:36.130
It doesn't matter if I 
get a good score myself.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.980
What's important is when they 
announce the results of the test!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:42.160
I'll dump Baby Beel off 
on whoever comes in first!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.170
Oh, it's a pill bug this time?

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.360
Let me see... It says that 1000 
pill bugs gets you 1 point.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.800
This is no time to be tallying!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.550
I'm screwed at this rate!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.840
I'm totally heading to the remedials in hell!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:01.230
I've gotta dump him off on 
someone before that, or...

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.690
Kawahara Sho...

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.440
You're cheating on filling in your name?!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:14.950
<b>"U"</b>

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.450
<b>"U"</b>

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.580
As long as I got my secret weapon...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.040
That's not how you use it!

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.130
Are they really that stupid?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:30.070
No, no... There's got to be one 
decent guy in the entire school!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.280
At least one who can study normally!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.970
Oh, no! Suppon High's invading!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.280
What?!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:42.770
Oh yeah... I heard that Kanzaki did 
a real number on them earlier...

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.960
They came to pay back the favor?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:45.600
Alright then!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.310
Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.540
Oga?

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:53.590
Leave this to me! The rest 
of you, finish the tests!

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:57.150
What's Oga so revved up about?

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:00.020
I've got to let them finish 
the tests in peace!

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.000
In order to find out who is 
the smartest guy in Ishiyama!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.350
I ain't lettin' you set 
even one foot past here.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.250
I will fight you!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.400
Who the hell are you?

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.630
You gonna take us on by yerself?

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.850
Let's do this, Baby Beel...

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.310
Zebel Blast...

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.270
An excellent combination technique.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:48.130
It looks like the master is well 
on his way to a passing score.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:58.170
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:02.310
Well, at least you avoided 
remedial lessons in hell.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:05.920
It's not any good. This 
can't continue on forever.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:10.190
I'm gonna dump Baby Beel off on the 
smartest guy in Ishiyama right away!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.640
<b>Test Results</b>

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:15.550
<b>0 Points {I think you're just fine without it.} {I don't need to guess at all their names, right}</b>

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:16.690
<b>1 Point</b>

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.570
How many points was this out of?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.130
<b>High Score
59 Points</b>

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.580
<b>Furuichi Takayuki</b>

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.280
Y-You're the top?!

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.980
Dear Great Demon Lord,

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.410
Have a lovely day, Master.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.860
It has been more than a month since I 
started living here in the Human world,

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.860
and I have grown accustomed to life here.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:06.870
<b>Hilda: Dear Great Demon Lord</b>

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.620
Take it like a man!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.250
Today, with the assistance of Alaindelon,

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:34.150
I have obtained the master's favorite, 
freshly squeezed milk from the King Hydra.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.310
Good morning, Hilda-san.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.540
Good morning, Father.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:48.270
Sorry, but could you pour me a beer?

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:48.950
Yes.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.910
Do you not have work today?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.750
I thought I'd maybe take 
an early summer vacation.

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:00.500
Here.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.560
Sorry 'bout this...

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.180
Whoa there...

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.930
This is the person acting 
as the master's grandfather.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.780
He may be the father of the one 
who is the master's parent,

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:21.300
but he does not seem to 
even possibly be related.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:25.410
Perhaps there is some hidden 
brutality somewhere?

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.410
You know, there's something...

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.100
I haven't really introduced myself to them,

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.550
but is your family doing well?

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.880
They're in Macao, yes?

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.960
Well, I haven't seen them in a little while.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:42.340
You haven't? Why is that?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:48.620
Why, you ask? It's because I am a demon 
maidservant(jijo) to the Great Demon Lord.

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.260
Second daughter(jijo)?

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:54.480
Oh, so the eldest daughter(choujo) 
takes care of the parents, then?

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.130
Chou jo?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.940
Hey Dear! What are you doing 
drinking beer in the morning?!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.120
I'm sorry!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.900
<b>Sliding Grovel</b>

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:06.050
Of note is his "sliding grovel".

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:10.100
This technique is the only 
one which piques my interest.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:16.850
His instantaneous reaction time and speed 
are not used for attack but for defense.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:19.710
Honestly speaking, it is not 
something I could have imagined.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:25.010
The other day, I tried to teach such 
a technique to the master, however...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.810
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:35.920
Forgive me, Mother!

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.140
It was just on a whim!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.400
It seemed simple enough at first glance,

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:42.210
but it requires a very 
high level of technique,

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.080
and he was unable to master it.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:52.200
<b>Notes on the "Sliding Grovel"
Name: Sliding Grovel
Command: ↓ ↑ ↖ Press (△◯) at once</b>

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:47.630
Perhaps it is the precise 
angles which are crucial?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.530
This will require more research.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.590
Hilda-chan!

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:55.430
Yes?

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:58.070
Would you help me out with the shopping?

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:00.830
I'm really sorry about that.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:04.210
Making you serve him beer 
so early in the morning...

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:08.230
This is the human who is 
the master's grandmother.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:13.930
If you were to ask who Oga Tatsumi most 
takes after, it would be this human.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.940
He didn't used to be like that, you know.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:22.120
Marriage(kekkon) ain't easy(amai), you know!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.830
Bloodstain(kekkon)?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:25.790
Sweet(amai)?

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.800
That's right! You and he still have it easy!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.740
Welcome, welcome! Always 
with low, low, prices!

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:40.370
This place is called a "supermarket".

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:45.080
Focusing mainly on food, all 
manner of things are sold here.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.010
Oh! This split mackerel is a bargain!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:52.130
I think I might decide on 
this for tonight's menu.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:58.390
The master has challenged quite a number 
of different foods from the Human World.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.210
But they proved to be quite tough.

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:05.730
Master!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.030
Master!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.920
Humans are so voracious though.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.870
They eat everything, from plants to animals...

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:39.930
Almost as if they think they are the 
top living creature to roam the earth.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:47.020
No being is more full of 
themselves as the humans.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:52.000
That is the Human World, yes... 
But there are also good aspects.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:57.380
This is something called a "Soap Opera" 
which I have been enjoying lately.

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:01.380
This week is a fateful match between 
a younger sister's former boyfriend,

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:04.680
and his older long-lost brother, 
taking place in the sumo ring...

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:07.660
You could never have foreseen 
them locking arms in combat!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.240
The master also enjoys television.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:15.190
He especially enjoys the 
anime called "Gohan-kun".

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.000
You've had about enough! 
Seconds helpings, that is!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.720
Damn you, Count Poo!

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.860
Gohan-kun!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:30.680
Today's toppings are Soy-boiled Sweet and 
Spicy Bonito-kun and Seaweed Flakes-chan!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:31.870
Leave it to us!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:34.070
Now, sprinkle me!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.000
In this country, it is said that 1 in 3

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:42.080
eats dinner while watching 
"Gohan-kun" each Sunday at 6:30.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.570
100 Times More Energy!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.700
And 1000 Extra Helpings!

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.620
Poop-poop!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:10.180
This institution is known as a "school", 
which the master's parent attends.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.210
Hey, you.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.270
I ain't seen your face around here.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:21.540
Who the hell are you?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:22.490
Hey.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.620
That's Oga's wife.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.500
Hey, you.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:35.450
I ain't seen your face around 
here. Who the hell are you?

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.630
What's the matter, Kanzaki-san?

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:43.600
Hey, you. I ain't seen your 
face around here. Who are you?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.630
Hey, you. I ain't seen your 
face around here. Who are you?

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.690
K-Kanzaki-san?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.780
What the heck's with that baby bottle?

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:07.790
Is she purposefully bringing that to 
school to get all the "new wife" appeal?

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:12.730
All of these people are ones who 
failed to become the master's parent.

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:19.850
A number of violent humans are gathered here,

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:23.280
but all of them are lacking when it 
comes to being the master's parent.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.310
Hilda-san! Why are you here?

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:32.290
This is also a human who 
is significantly lacking.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.900
Is Oga Tatsumi here?

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.940
If you want Oga, he went 
to fight with Suppon High.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.120
Just as usual, I see.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.050
If he returns, give this to him.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:54.460
The master's milk.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.210
B-Breast milk?!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.670
Just joking!

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.980
Oh, no! Hilda-san...

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.740
Oh, Hilda-chan!

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:11.310
Welcome home, Hilda-chan.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:15.040
This is the master's aunt.

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:20.880
In the Human World, it is common for 
families to all share one living space,

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.100
and to eat together.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.120
Look at this, Hilda-chan!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.150
These are battered cod cakes!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.560
Bacalhau croquets!

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.710
And I made these egg tarts for dessert!

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.460
Doesn't this Macao cooking 
remind you of home?

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:36.710
Macao cooking?

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:40.610
I heard from Dad that you haven't 
seen your family for a long time.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:45.090
So I changed plans, and tried 
my hand at some Macao cooking!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.470
It's our first time, so we can't 
guarantee they'll taste right, though.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.970
And you! Don't just drink 
beer like a fool! Help out!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.830
Sorry!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.230
What am I to do with you, Dad?

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.630
How about get me another beer?

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.120
What're you doing?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.270
Want a croquet?

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.100
This man is Oga Tatsumi.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:23.940
He is the man that is the 
parent of the master.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.600
Huh? What're you smilin' at me for?

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.880
Nothing. We're going home.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.100
Today it seems like we 
are having Macao cooking.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.270
Sheesh. What's with her?

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:45.400
Great Demon Lord, I think I will stay 
with this man for a little while longer.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.980
Royal Straight Flush!

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:52.490
Great Demon Lord, I think you 
have the wrong game again...

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:56.000
Oh? That so? My head is huuuuge...

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:29.480
Dear Great Demon Lord,

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:33.420
It has been more than 1 month that 
I have spent in the Human World,

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:35.930
and I have not gotten used 
to living here at all.

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:39.860
To get off those tough oily spots,

00:23:39.860 --> 00:23:45.920
all you need to do is sprinkle some leftover 
flour from the tempura, and they'll come right off.

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:49.990
You totally fit right in!

00:24:01.850 --> 00:24:04.340
I am Kanzaki, of the Ishiyama TKKH!

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:07.760
I've finally realized what I lack...

00:24:07.760 --> 00:24:09.150
I lack a special move!

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:10.640
Like shooting lasers from your eyes?

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:12.040
That's not humanly possible.

00:24:12.350 --> 00:24:13.540
The, shooting yogurti out of your nose?

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:15.690
Oh, it burns! It burns...

00:24:15.690 --> 00:24:18.020
It's only a matter of time before you cower in fear!

00:24:18.550 --> 00:24:20.660
I'm gonna find an awesome special move!

00:24:21.570 --> 00:24:24.550
On the next Beelzebub: Is There a Special Move?

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:28.260
FYI, my special move is the "Lovey-Dovey-Dewy-Eyed Wink"!
